flowchart LR
  Source[Source Record] --> Raw[Raw Payload Reference]
  Source --> Normalize[Normalization]
  Normalize --> Evidence[Evidence Object]
  Evidence --> Claim[Fact / Inference / Hypothesis / Unknown]
  Claim --> Brief[Reality Investigation Brief]
  AI[AI Execution] --> Claim
  AI --> Provenance[Model + Prompt + Context + Tools + Output]
  Human[Human Review] --> Decision[Human Decision]
  Brief --> Decision
